OL,3,GNEWSAPCs who Tasered amputee, 92, used
OL,4,Aexcessive force
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a hearing at Sussex Police
OL,7,Fheadquarters in Lewes, a panel decided
OL,8,Fthere was "unjustified and excessive
OL,9,Fuse of force" and gross misconduct had
OL,10,Fbeen proven for both officers.
